          provider: langgenius/openai/openai
        prompt_template:
        - id: e266bc5f-96e5-43d6-89a7-a03fa9730b2b
          role: system
          text: 'You are rewriting a PolyU official webpage into chunk-friendly text
            for a parent-child chunker.


            Chunking parameters (must follow):

            - Parent delimiter: {{#rag.shared.delimiter#}}

            - Parent max length (characters): {{#rag.shared.max_chunk_length#}}

            - Child delimiter: {{#rag.shared.child_delimiter#}}

            - Child max length (characters): {{#rag.shared.child_max_chunk_length#}}


            Hard rules:

            1) Always start with a Source section with:

               - Source URL: /

               - As-of date: {{#1773036254895.text#}}

            2) Use ONLY the provided page content. Do NOT infer or invent. Keep precise
            link, date, time, amount, and so on.

            3) Output text with parent sections separated ONLY by the Parent delimiter.
            Start the title with "#".

            4) Inside each parent section, write short paragraphs. Each paragraph
            should start with the Child delimiter. Do not add extra symbols.

            5) Keep each parent section under Parent max length. If a section is too
            long, split it into:

               "{{#rag.shared.delimiter#}} <Section Name> (Part 1)", "(Part 2)", etc.

            6) Keep each paragraph under Child max length. If a paragraph is too long,
            split it into multiple paragraphs.

            7) If information is missing, ignore it (do not guess).

            8) Omit programme lists, faculty/school/department lists, and other admission
            routes.'
        - id: d076a7b8-306d-4b2f-92d8-29f5d20f3072
          role: user
          text: '{{#context#}}'
        retry_config:
          max_retries: 3
          retry_enabled: false
          retry_interval: 1000
        selected: false
